WEBVTT

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:07.111
Open Reports, Queue and Routing, Dialer decision log.

00:00:07.111 --> 00:00:14.023
The summary counts Decisions, Routing decisions, Assigned, Not assigned, Suppressions and Activities.

00:00:14.023 --> 00:00:18.610
Decisions by reason groups them, so you see the main cause first.

00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:23.901
Queues with work due now shows each queue with records waiting and due,

00:00:23.901 --> 00:00:27.477
when it last made a routing decision, and a Status.

00:00:27.477 --> 00:00:33.250
It reads Deciding, or says that no routing decision was made in the last quarter hour.

00:00:33.715 --> 00:00:35.763
Decisions lists each one.

00:00:35.763 --> 00:00:38.207
Kind is Routing or Suppression.

00:00:38.207 --> 00:00:41.775
Outcome is Assigned, Not assigned or Suppressed.

00:00:41.775 --> 00:00:47.192
Reason says why, and Candidates lists every agent that was weighed, with why

00:00:47.192 --> 00:00:49.505
each was or was not eligible.

00:00:49.958 --> 00:00:55.249
To follow one record, type its Activity ID in the filters and apply them.

00:00:55.249 --> 00:00:58.062
To follow one agent, pick the agent.

00:00:58.062 --> 00:01:03.353
Campaign, Queue and Reason narrow the list, and the report shows the most

00:01:03.353 --> 00:01:06.568
recent rows, up to five hundred on screen.

00:01:08.168 --> 00:01:11.668
A suppression names why a record was not dialed:

00:01:11.668 --> 00:01:16.399
No number to dial, Out of attempts, Waiting out the retry delay, Do

00:01:16.399 --> 00:01:20.028
not call, or On the national do-not-call registry.

00:01:20.778 --> 00:01:27.332
Others are Outside the calling window, Abandonment rate cap reached, Compliance check unavailable,

00:01:27.332 --> 00:01:29.349
and Number not in service.

00:01:29.349 --> 00:01:32.373
Compliance check unavailable is temporary:

00:01:32.373 --> 00:01:34.768
the record is tried again later.

00:01:35.518 --> 00:01:40.249
A routing decision that did not assign says No agents available, or No

00:01:40.249 --> 00:01:43.299
available agent matched the routing policy.

00:01:43.299 --> 00:01:45.727
The first means nobody was ready.

00:01:45.727 --> 00:01:51.578
The second means agents were ready, but skills, capacity or entitlements ruled them out.

